{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01087",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 5.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "I mean, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.08,
      "end_seconds": 9.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.01,
      "end_seconds": 18.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "Doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.65,
      "end_seconds": 29.32,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "Mainly an itchy patch on my wrist. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.26,
      "end_seconds": 34.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.71,
      "end_seconds": 54.13,
      "duration_seconds": 19.42,
      "text": "Right, I'm on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. Clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.08,
      "end_seconds": 56.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Is that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.35,
      "end_seconds": 62.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "About six months. A plain moisturiser, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.91,
      "end_seconds": 75.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.98,
      "end_seconds": 78.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Probably two weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.9,
      "end_seconds": 88.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.1,
      "end_seconds": 107.51,
      "duration_seconds": 17.41,
      "text": "Moisturiser helps a bit. I notice it more with my new watch strap. I've also had a bit of redness. I've had dry flaky skin too, for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.2,
      "end_seconds": 110.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "What about blisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.18,
      "end_seconds": 114.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Not at all, no blisters."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.73,
      "end_seconds": 118.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "And what about fever or spreading?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.39,
      "end_seconds": 123.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "I haven't had fever or spreading, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.7,
      "end_seconds": 129.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.89,
      "end_seconds": 131.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.6,
      "end_seconds": 138.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.88,
      "end_seconds": 140.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.57,
      "end_seconds": 159.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.0,
      "end_seconds": 169.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.11,
      "end_seconds": 173.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.76,
      "end_seconds": 178.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.82,
      "end_seconds": 183.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.34,
      "end_seconds": 189.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.62,
      "end_seconds": 191.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.01,
      "end_seconds": 198.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.47,
      "end_seconds": 209.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.38,
      "end_seconds": 213.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.15,
      "end_seconds": 217.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.61,
      "end_seconds": 223.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Actually, just a triple bypass, eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.39,
      "end_seconds": 226.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.4,
      "end_seconds": 240.95,
      "duration_seconds": 13.55,
      "text": "Anxiety, for about a year. I have heart disease. I looked a few things up online, uh, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.17,
      "end_seconds": 251.32,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Okay, I can see anxiety in your file as well. Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.98,
      "end_seconds": 254.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.68,
      "end_seconds": 258.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.28,
      "end_seconds": 272.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.35,
      "end_seconds": 290.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.8 degrees, heart rate 75, BP is 124 over 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.8,
      "end_seconds": 295.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Is that alright, um, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.73,
      "end_seconds": 299.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.82,
      "end_seconds": 305.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.41,
      "end_seconds": 324.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.37,
      "end_seconds": 327.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.12,
      "end_seconds": 348.78,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "There's a neat red patch where the watch strap sits, with a little scaling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.07,
      "end_seconds": 363.65,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. So, to recap quickly. You've had an itchy patch on your wrist for two weeks, and no spreading or blisters."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.38,
      "end_seconds": 367.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.19,
      "end_seconds": 385.18,
      "duration_seconds": 15.99,
      "text": "We'll begin with hydrocortisone cream, 1%, once a day, one week. That's for contact dermatitis. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Stop wearing that strap and keep the skin moisturised."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.5,
      "end_seconds": 397.17,
      "duration_seconds": 11.67,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. I'd like to see you again if it has not cleared in two weeks. So, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.0,
      "end_seconds": 402.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.75,
      "end_seconds": 405.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}